OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's 32 councils could be
OL,4,Acut to six under government plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's 32 councils could be
OL,7,Freplaced by as few as six regional
OL,8,Fauthorities, the government has
OL,9,Fsuggested.
OL,11,FUnder proposals for a new two-tier
OL,12,Fsystem, the regional bodies would focus
OL,13,Fon major issues such as education and
OL,14,Feconomic growth.
OL,16,FBetween 120 and 160 community
OL,17,Fauthorities would also be created. They
OL,18,Fwould be expected to contribute to
OL,19,Flocal issues such as licensing and town
OL,20,Fcentre improvements.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
